{"id":55279,"date":"2026-07-30T14:58:22","date_gmt":"2026-07-30T13:58:22","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilhos-da-raposa\/"},"modified":"2026-08-28T21:01:31","modified_gmt":"2026-08-28T20:01:31","slug":"trilhos-da-raposa","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilhos-da-raposa\/","title":{"rendered":"Trilhos da Raposa 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 1 - DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre O <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trilhos da Raposa 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os <strong>Trilhos da Raposa 2026<\/strong> (4.\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realizam-se no dia <strong>18 de Outubro de 2026 (Domingo)<\/strong>, na pitoresca vila de <strong>Cercal do Alentejo<\/strong>, no concelho de Santiago do Cac\u00e9m (distrito de Set\u00fabal). O evento destaca a beleza selvagem dos montados e serranias do sudoeste alentejano.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partidas agendadas a partir das <strong>09:00<\/strong> no Largo dos Caeiros, o programa disponibiliza o Trail Longo de <strong>22 km<\/strong>, o Trail Sprint de <strong>16 km<\/strong>, o Mini Trail de <strong>10 km<\/strong> e uma Caminhada solid\u00e1ria de <strong>10 km<\/strong>. Se pretende planear a sua \u00e9poca no litoral e interior alentejano, pode consultar o nosso direct\u00f3rio de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail-running\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">eventos de trail running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela equipa Raposas do Cercal, a prova assegura postos de abastecimento bem abastecidos, marca\u00e7\u00f5es de percurso rigorosas, seguro desportivo e uma rece\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00edpica alentejana na meta.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 2 - FICHA T\u00c9CNICA --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">18 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Largo dos Caeiros, Cercal do Alentejo, Santiago do Cac\u00e9m, Set\u00fabal<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">22 km, 16 km e 10 km<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Raposas do Cercal (com apoio do Munic\u00edpio de Santiago do Cac\u00e9m)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">5h00m (tempo limite oficial)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Abastecimentos<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos nos pontos interm\u00e9dios dos percursos e refor\u00e7o final na meta<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 3 - GEOMETRIA & PERCURSO --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da Prova &#038; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Percurso<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O percurso dos <strong>Trilhos da Raposa 2026<\/strong> percorre os caminhos ancestrais da Serra do Cercal, alternando <em>trilhos florestais entre sobreiros e azinheiras, tro\u00e7os de pedra solta, caminhos de montado e travessias de ribeiras<\/em>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O perfil altim\u00e9trico \u00e9 <em>exigente e ondulado<\/em>, apresentando desn\u00edveis acumulados que exigem boa gest\u00e3o de esfor\u00e7o e cal\u00e7ado de trail adequado.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 5 - ONDE FICAR --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udfe8 Onde Ficar em <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Santiago do Cac\u00e9m<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Para atletas e fam\u00edlias que pretendem pernoitar na regi\u00e3o antes ou depois do <strong>Trilhos da Raposa 2026<\/strong>, recomendamos reservas antecipadas em zonas estrat\u00e9gicas de Santiago do Cac\u00e9m:<\/p>\n<ul style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>Cercal do Alentejo &#038; Largo dos Caeiros:<\/strong> Hospedagem em turismo rural e casas de campo no centro do Cercal com acesso a p\u00e9.<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>Vila Nova de Milfontes &#038; Costa Vicentina:<\/strong> Alojamentos na linha costeira de Santiago do Cac\u00e9m a escassos minutos do evento.<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\"><strong>Santiago do Cac\u00e9m:<\/strong> Excelente oferta de restaura\u00e7\u00e3o e alojamento no centro do concelho.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 6 - GASTRONOMIA & ACOMPANHANTES --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udf0d Sobre o Local &#038; <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Gastronomia Regional<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A regi\u00e3o de <strong>Santiago do Cac\u00e9m<\/strong> oferece um patrim\u00f3nio cultural e paisag\u00edstico rico. Ap\u00f3s o esfor\u00e7o da prova, os participantes podem desfrutar dos sabores locais da gastronomia regional, como <em>carne de porco alentejana, a\u00e7orda serrana, queijo de serpa, enchidos tradicionais e doces de am\u00eandoa<\/em> em restaurantes t\u00edpicos da localidade.<\/p>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 20px; margin-top: 20px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83d\udc65 Guia de Acompanhantes &#038; Espectadores<\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Os acompanhantes e fam\u00edlias podem assistir \u00e0 prova e apoiar os atletas em locais estrat\u00e9gicos como <strong>Largo dos Caeiros, Cercal do Alentejo, moinhos da serra e vales florestais<\/strong>, desfrutando da anima\u00e7\u00e3o e do acolhimento local.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 7 - FAQS ALINHADAS COM FICHA T\u00c9CNICA --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas Frequentes <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">(Trilhos da Raposa 2026)<\/span><\/h2>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px;\">\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida do Trilhos da Raposa 2026?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento realiza-se no dia <strong>18 de Outubro de 2026 (Domingo)<\/strong>. Os hor\u00e1rios das v\u00e1rias partidas por prova e escal\u00e3o s\u00e3o os seguintes:<br \/>\u2022 09:00 &#8211; Partida do Trail Longo (22 km)<br \/>\u2022 09:15 &#8211; Partida do Trail Sprint (16 km), Mini Trail (10 km) e Caminhada (10 km)<br \/>\u2022 Meta no Largo dos Caeiros em Cercal do Alentejo<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se realiza a prova e qual \u00e9 o concelho e distrito?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">A partida tem lugar em <strong>Largo dos Caeiros, Cercal do Alentejo, Santiago do Cac\u00e9m<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Set\u00fabal<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias oficiais dispon\u00edveis no Trilhos da Raposa 2026?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa oficial disponibiliza as dist\u00e2ncias de <strong>22 km, 16 km e 10 km<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade organizadora do Trilhos da Raposa 2026?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o do evento \u00e9 assegurada por <strong>Raposas do Cercal (com apoio do Munic\u00edpio de Santiago do Cac\u00e9m)<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<details style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar os resultados e as fotografias da prova?<\/summary>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px; margin-bottom: 0;\">As classifica\u00e7\u00f5es finais e os tempos oficiais poder\u00e3o ser acedidos na p\u00e1gina da prova no portal <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">Portugal Running<\/a> ap\u00f3s o encerramento do evento. A fotorreportagem e as galerias de imagens poder\u00e3o ser pesquisadas atrav\u00e9s dos canais oficiais da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o e nas plataformas parceiras de cobertura fotogr\u00e1fica desportiva.<\/p>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":55280,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[728,820,48],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-55279","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-cercal-do-alentejo-setubal","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-algarve-e-sul","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_2-setubal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/6a6a17dc3efcd_Cartaz-cartaz_460.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/55279","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=55279"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/55279\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":65135,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/55279\/revisions\/65135"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/55280"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=55279"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=55279"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type?post=55279"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_2","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_2?post=55279"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_3","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_3?post=55279"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_4","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_4?post=55279"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_5","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_5?post=55279"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}